{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, pick it up, process it, and put it down. If not, approach it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />     <Action ID = PickUpObject    />     <Action ID = PutDownObject    /> </Sequence>\"",
    "BT": {
